# Coding Standards

- Keep code dry: no comments, no noise, no dead code
- Names of files, functions, and variables must be self-explanatory
- No `console.log` unless debugging a concrete issue; remove before finishing
- Prefer small focused files; extract when a file grows past ~100 lines or gains a second responsibility
- Stack is React + Vite + TypeScript only; do not add dependencies unless the user explicitly asks
- Identifiers and code in English; user-facing copy may be English or Russian as requested
- Do not invent features, styling systems, or libs beyond the current task
